 first time, then returns the stored value","A vector of Box<dyn FnMut(&str)> handlers holds different closures, each with its own mutable state","A closure that captured a reference must not outlive it; a move closure owns its data and can leave the function"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["struct Cache<F: Fn(u64) -> u64> {","    f: F,","    value: Option<u64>,","}"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":17.0,"w":340.0},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":110.0,"y":130.0,"w":120.0,"h":24.0,"text":"first call: f(x)","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":260.0,"y":130.0,"w":120.0,"h":24.0,"text":"later: from value","tone":"green","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"v","x":70.0,"y":40.0,"w":110.0,"h":24.0,"text":"handlers: Vec<…>","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":60.0,"y":96.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"|s| log.push(s)","tone":"blue","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":170.0,"y":96.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"|s| count += 1","tone":"blue","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":280.0,"y":96.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"|s| println!(s)","tone":"blue","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":70.0,"y1":52.0,"x2":60.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":90.0,"y1":52.0,"x2":160.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":110.0,"y1":52.0,"x2":260.0,"y2":80.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["fn make(name: &str) -> impl Fn() -> usize + '_ {","    move || name.len()","}","fn owned(s: String) -> impl Fn() -> usize {","    move || s.len()      // no '_ : owns"],"hl":[0,3],"lang":"rust","size":8.0,"lh":17.0,"w":350.0}]],"cues":[11.2,20.4]}]},{"title":"Summary","sub":"What next","short":"Summary","main":"Next, lifetimes and smart pointers.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Closure","Iterators","Next"],"captions":["A closure is an anonymous struct with captured values; Fn, FnMut, and FnOnce reflect what it does to its environment","Adapters are lazy, consumers run the pipeline, and the compiler folds it all into one fast loop","Next, reference lifetimes and smart pointers: Box, Rc, Arc, Weak, RefCell"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"capture\n&, &mut, move","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"Fn / FnMut\nFnOnce","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"struct\nwith environment","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"adapters\nlazy","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"consumers\nrun","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"one loop","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"Box · Rc\nArc","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"RefCell\nWeak","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":290.0,"y":66.0,"w":100.0,"h":34.0,"text":"reference\nlifetimes","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[9.6,21.8]}]}]}